        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Harmonie bewahren. Das Gleichgewicht bewahren. Manchmal muss erst etwas sterben, damit etwas anderes leben kann.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Preservar la armonía. Mantener el equilibrio. A veces, algo debe morir para que otro pueda vivir.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Preserving harmony. Maintaining balance. Sometimes one thing must die so that another may live.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Preservare l'armonia. Mantenere l'equilibrio. A volte una cosa deve morire per far sì che un'altra possa vivere.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Préserver l'harmonie. Maintenir l'équilibre. Parfois quelque chose doit mourir pour qu'autre chose puisse vivre.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JBT1A7XTBZCWZ3W6TY2Y08A0",
      "text": "Preserving harmony. Maintaining balance. Sometimes one thing must die so that another may live."
    }
  ],
